{"id":"vieles","lemma":"vieles","pos":"pron","rank":1725,"glosses":["much, many things"],"ipa":"/ˈfiːləs/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/e/ec/De-vieles.ogg/De-vieles.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Du hast mir so vieles beigebracht.","en":"You've taught me so much.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/761447","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"ich"},{"g":"so"},null,{"g":"to teach","l":"beibringen"}]},{"text":"Ich möchte dir so vieles sagen.","en":"There's so much I want to say to you.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to like","l":"mögen"},{"g":"(to) you","l":"du"},{"g":"so"},null,{"g":"to say (to pronounce"}]},{"text":"Wir müssen für vieles dankbar sein.","en":"We have many things to be grateful for.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"to have to"},{"g":"for"},null,{"g":"grateful, thankful"},{"g":"to be"}]},{"text":"Ich muss noch vieles lernen.","en":"I've still got a lot to learn.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to have to","l":"müssen"},{"g":"still / yet"},null,{"g":"to learn"}]},{"text":"Es gibt vieles, was ich mag.","en":"I like a lot of things.","words":[null,null,null,{"g":"what"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"to like","l":"mögen"}],"phrases":[[0,2,"there is, there are"]]}]}